{
  "id": "p01-signature-canonical-json",
  "asserts": "signature's canonical JSON is derived from a program trace's causal stream, not from its source location: a run that raised, unwound and never returned reports outcome raised / disposition PROPAGATED / fork.qualname naming the raising frame by its file-local qualname, excludes exc.msg, and hashes to the same key when the same code is renamed to a different file at composition.",
